    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i wasted everything. 20 years of working every single day, building that agency, thinking i was actually getting somewhere... and now it's just gone. the bankruptcy, the lawsuits, the fact that i have nothing left to show for it. it feels like i've just been pouring my life into a void for two decades and there's nothing at the end of it. what was even the point?",
