    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "new beginnings feels like a joke when you're standing in the wreckage of everything you built. i don't want a \"new beginning,\" i just want to stop feeling like this. it's like i've spent my entire life playing a game where the rules keep changing just so i'll lose. i'm just so exhausted. there's no more energy left to try and \"grow\" from this. it just feels like a massive, empty loss.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
